msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "We just released Quarkus 0.21.2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release is all about fixing bugs, usability and documentation issues. "
"We are still working on our next big release which will be 0.22.0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can find https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/0.21.2[the "
"full changelog of 0.21.2] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

msgid "We have a lot of interesting things in the works so stay tuned."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus has now https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[142 "
"contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In particular for this release, thanks to Bertrand Rousseau, chaminnk, "
"Clement Escoffier, Daniel Ribeiro, David M. Lloyd, Dennis Baerten, George "
"Gastaldi, Georgios Andrianakis, Guillaume Smet, Gunnar Morling, Gwenneg "
"Lepage, Maciej Swiderski, Manyanda Chitimbo, Martin Kouba, Matej Novotny, "
"Matteo Mortari, Rostislav Svoboda, Sergey Beryozkin, Stéphane Epardaud and "
"Stuart Douglas."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
